            "summary": "The Sweden Democrats' party board decides to exclude Hylte politician Stina Isaksson from the party with immediate effect. \"We can confirm that Stina Isaksson has today been excluded from the Sweden Democrats. This is by decision of the party board,\" writes the Sweden Democrats' press department to SVT.",
            "fullText": "The Sweden Democrats' party board decides to exclude Hylte politician Stina Isaksson from the party with immediate effect.\n\n\"We can confirm that Stina Isaksson has today been excluded from the Sweden Democrats. This is by decision of the party board,\" writes the Sweden Democrats' press department to SVT.\n\nOn Thursday, the Sweden Democrats' party board announced its announcement. They write in the message that they take a serious view of SD in Hylte handing out flyers with the text \"stop the social services taking care of your children\".\n\nStina Isaksson writes in a post on social media that \"Everything you have fought for, straight into the bin. Your whole life has been radically turned upside down.\"\n\nShe also announces in the post that she will remain as a political savage in the region and the municipality for the rest of the year. Isaksson also comments on the leaflets and describes them as \"horribly ill-thought-out, and clumsily expressed\" and continues:\n\n\"We never intended to contribute to any disinformation campaign or conspiracy theory. To everyone who was negatively affected by this and who took offense, I want to sincerely apologize. To be expelled from the party for that, I think that is unreasonable. I could have been given a warning or maybe taken my parliamentary seat.\"\n\nSVT's news must stand for objectivity and impartiality. What we publish must be true and relevant. In urgent news situations, it can be difficult to get all the facts confirmed, so we will tell you what we know - and don't know. Read more about how we work.",
